        <field>Body__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">&lt;p&gt;Dashboard Builder is where you assemble custom dashboards out of saved reports plus standalone widgets (text, image, Lightning component). Drag tiles onto a 12-column canvas, configure how each one renders, and save. Viewers see the same layout in Dashboard Viewer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each tile is a &lt;strong&gt;Dashboard Component&lt;/strong&gt; record bound to a single source — a saved Report Definition for charts/tables, or a standalone configuration for text/image/LWC tiles.&lt;/p&gt;</value>
